      "text/html": [
       "<div class=\"tex2jax_ignore\"><em>\\[\n",
       "f(x)=x^3-3x\n",
       "\\]\n",
       "\n",
       "Differentiating:\n",
       "\n",
       "\\[\n",
       "f&#x27;(x)=3x^2-3=3(x^2-1)=3(x-1)(x+1)\n",
       "\\]\n",
       "\n",
       "Setting the derivative equal to zero gives:\n",
       "\n",
       "\\[\n",
       "3(x-1)(x+1)=0\n",
       "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n",
       "x=-1,\\;1\n",
       "\\]\n",
       "\n",
       "The corresponding points on the original curve are:\n",
       "\n",
       "\\[\n",
       "f(-1)=2,\\qquad f(1)=-2\n",
       "\\]\n",
       "\n",
       "Thus, the stationary points are:\n",
       "\n",
       "\\[\n",
       "\\boxed{(-1,2)\\text{ and }(1,-2)}\n",
       "\\]</em></div>"
      ],
